      "cooked": "<p>Say you come across one of Ambuscade's traps and you reschuffle it back into his deck face up.&nbsp; Later on during his villain turn you draw a card and the card under it is a face up trap.&nbsp; Does the trap go off immediately before the drawn card is played?&nbsp; Do you play the drawn card then the trap goes off?&nbsp; If so, what if at the end of the card drawn it says reschuffle the villain deck?&nbsp; Does the trap then not get triggered?</p>",
